# M4.24 final review — remote-ref lookup

Date: 2026-08-28

## Failure

The post-push review tried to resolve the local remote-tracking name
`origin/feat/m4-24-network-free-first-start-acceptance`. This checkout does not
create that tracking ref on push, so Git returned an ambiguous-revision error.

## Cause and impact

The local name was an invalid verification assumption. The authenticated PR
query independently confirmed Draft PR #33 at
`ab775982263392de6b9d83ae01f2be55dd2e5aef` with successful CI. No repository,
server, unit, contract or provider state was changed by the failed read.

## Minimal correction

Verify the authoritative remote branch with read-only `git ls-remote --heads`
and compare its returned object ID with local HEAD and the PR head object ID.

## Rollback

No runtime rollback applies. This diagnosis is documentation-only.
